	measure '# Inbound Active-Co-sell Referral' = ```
			CALCULATE ( 
			    [# Partner Deals], 
			    KEEPFILTERS ( 'Partner Deal'[Partner Deal Direction] = "Inbound" ),
			    KEEPFILTERS ( 'Partner Deal'[Referral SubType] = "Active Co-sell - PC" ),
			    REMOVEFILTERS ( 'Partner Deal'[IsDealWith#PartnerGTM] )
			)
			```
		formatString: #,0
		lineageTag: 8fc5eaf0-daf7-43be-9466-47489d2889e7

